<title>THAILAND: Advance Agro 1996 loss rises sharply.</title>
<headline>Advance Agro 1996 loss rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for</p>
<p>year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)    loss     2.57     vs    loss    0.27</p>
<p>    Net	     loss   912.98     vs    loss   95.54</p>
<p>NOTES: Revs not stated. Company's full name is Advance Agro Plc, an agricultural and commodity group.</p>
